 ${misc:Depends}
Description: CusDeb ReactOS Explorer desktop environment (base)
 Custom ReactOS Explorer shell, taskbar bridge, and supporting
 configuration for the CusDeb Win32 desktop. This package builds a
 selected subset of ReactOS from source and installs it together with
 the LightDM/Openbox session needed to run it under Wine.

